{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","缚魔枪"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Demonseal Spear"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","击退并定身周围的敌人。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Korin knocks back nearby enemies and immobilizes them."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","科林舞枪横扫，对自身周围2格的敌军造成4次70% + 10% ATK伤害，并使其定身2秒。命中周围1格的敌军时，会额外将其向外击退1格。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Korin sweeps his spear at enemies within 2 tiles, dealing 70% + 10% ATK damage 4 times and immobilizing them for 2s. Hitting adjacent enemies will also knock them back 1 tile."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":61,"end":67,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":58,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","定身时间提升至4秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases immobilize duration to 4s."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至75% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 75% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至80% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 80% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/0/varia