end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","该次伤害必定暴击且自身每1%暴击率提高1.6% + 0.1%的暴击伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","For every 1% of his crit rate, his critical damage is increased by 1.6% + 0.1%."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":71,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases Haste during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升12点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 12 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 16 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升20点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 20 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","蔓生义肢"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Vine Arms"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","周围友方英雄释放一定次数的终极技能使得自身伤害附带真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Korin deals additional true damage to enemies when he and allied heroes cast a certain amount of Ultimates."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身及2格范围内的友军每累计释放3次终极技能引发自身义肢共鸣，使得自身长枪附魔绿裔魔法，后续8秒内，每次造成伤害，会额外附加目标最大生命值2%的真实伤害，该伤害最高不超过自身40%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When Korin and the allies within 2 tiles cast their Ultimates 3 times in total, Korin's arms feel nature's power and enchant his spear with Wilder magic, dealing additional true damage equal to 2% of the targets' max HP for 8s with follow-up attacks, and the extra damage cannot exceed 40% of Korin's ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","期间自身攻击速度提高60点。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 60 during the skill."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","额外附加伤害提升至目标最大生命值2.5%的真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases additional true damage to 2.5% of the targets' max HP."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","额外附加伤害提升至目标最大生命值2.8%的真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases additional true damage to 2.8% of the targets' max HP."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","1格以外的敌人对自身造成的伤害降低。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Korin reduces damage taken from enemy beyond 1 tile."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","距离自身超过1格的敌军对自身造成伤害时，该次伤害降低25%。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Korin reduces damage taken from enemy beyond 1 tile by 25%."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","丛林之刺"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Sylvan Spear"]]}